ics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1406,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"Everyone assumes CoWoS spilling over to ASE and Amkor just means the OSATs add a few more lines. But to actually catch that overflow, they first need machines big enough to bond an entire AI chip package in one go. That's what today's Korea Economic TV exclusive is about.\n\nPer https://t.co/KJeh71riLf https://t.co/ZK6mTXseqT","url":"https://x.com/Leoskie_L/status/2112521719735054584"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112401872594350080"]},"author_id":"135762800","created_at":"2026-10-20T04:33:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112401897298739503"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/MCJmkXv6ng","end":207,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/yis9617/status/2112401897298739503/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112401872594350080","start":184,"url":"https://t.co/MCJmkXv6ng"}]},"id":"2112401897298739503","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Grok 4.7 vs GPT-6, 이번 가을 판가름은 파라미터가 아니라 '추론 토큰당 단가'에서 갈림. 벤치 점수 몇 점 차이는 이미 무의미해진 국면임.\n\nxAI가 밀어붙이는 건 컨텍스트 윈도우가 아니라 학습 클러스터 증설 속도임. Grok 4.7의 실질 경쟁력은 콜로서스(Colossus) 2세대 랙 밀도에서 나옴. GB200 https://t.co/MCJmkXv6ng","url":"https://x.com/yis9617/status/2112401897298739503"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112614147506782208"]},"author_id":"135762800","created_at":"2026-10-20T18:37:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112614171254870154"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/DkIAUjs1l4","end":196,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/yis9617/status/2112614171254870154/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112614147506782208","start":173,"url":"https://t.co/DkIAUjs1l4"}]},"id":"2112614171254870154","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":25,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"BAT 3사가 엔비디아에 350억 달러어치 주문 넣었다는 뉴스. 헤드라인만 보면 \"중국 AI 굴기 부활\"인데, 밑단 뜯어보면 얘기가 달라짐.\n\n솔직히 칩 숫자는 소음임. 350억 달러면 H20급이든 뭐든 물량 스케일 자랑인데, 이거 구조 뜯어보니까 진짜 병목은 칩이 아니라 CoWoS 인터포저랑 HBM 패키징 https://t.co/DkIAUjs1l4","url":"https://x.com/yis9617/status/2112614171254870154"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112385797517430784"]},"author_id":"1427395053194907655","created_at":"2026-10-20T03:32:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112386429624230190"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/EbWGs2212U","end":303,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/teslayoda/status/2112386429624230190/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112385797517430784","start":280,"url":"https://t.co/EbWGs2212U"}]},"id":"2112386429624230190","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3158,"like_count":33,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":7},"text":"Fate loves irony.\n\nWhat makes Terafab hard is also what could make it work. Terafab wants logic, memory and advanced packaging under one roof, which lets the job be split by strength. \n\n1. Chip design: Terafab designs its own logic and memory chips and supplies the site, energy, https://t.co/EbWGs2212U","url":"https://x.com/teslayoda/status/2112386429624230190"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112435353571516417"]},"author_id":"135762800","created_at":"2026-10-20T06:46:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112435376497553853"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/LnrdZT3IRs","end":190,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/yis9617/status/2112435376497553853/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112435353571516417","start":167,"url":"https://t.co/LnrdZT3IRs"}]},"id":"2112435376497553853","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"칩 성능 경쟁은 이미 끝났음. 진짜 승부는 전력과 인터커넥트 대역폭에서 갈림. Grok 4.7이든 GPT-6 패밀리든, 모델 스펙표만 보는 건 밸류체인의 절반만 읽는 셈임.\n\n이번 가을 릴리스의 공통점은 명확함. 학습 연산량이 아니라 추론 시점의 토큰당 전력 효율이 지표로 올라옴. 프런티어 랩들이 https://t.co/LnrdZT3IRs","url":"https://x.com/yis9617/status/2112435376497553853"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112785738836369408","3_2112785738777714688"]},"author_id":"1311092083252277